%% Youth Account Management - Main User Flows
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application (UI)
    participant API as Youth Account Management Service (REST API)
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant TxnSvc as Transaction Service
    participant SettingsDB as Settings DB

    %% Dashboard Access
    Parent->>WebApp: Login & navigate to dashboard
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/dashboard
    API->>AccountSvc: Retrieve youth account details
    API->>SettingsDB: Get spending limit
    API->>TxnSvc: Fetch recent transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Dashboard summary (balance, limit, recent txns)
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display dashboard
    Note over API: Audit log: dashboardAccess

    %% Fund Transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund allocation
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/fund-transfer
    API->>AccountSvc: Validate parent & youth accounts
    API->>AccountSvc: Debit parent, credit youth account
    API->>TxnSvc: Record fund transfer transaction
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer result (success/fail, updated balance)
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer result
    Note over API: Audit log: fundTransfers

    %% Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set weekly limit
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/spending-limit
    API->>SettingsDB: Update weekly limit
    API-->>WebApp: Limit updated confirmation
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show limit update result
    Note over API: Audit log: spendingLimitChanges

    %% Transaction History
    Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/transactions
    API->>TxnSvc: Query transactions (with pagination)
    API-->>WebApp: Transaction list
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display transaction history
